steps.text:
Bind the cursor commands with `logicalLine: true` in `keybindings.json`:

```json
[
  {
    "key": "ctrl+alt+down",
    "command": "editor.action.insertCursorBelow",
    "args": { "logicalLine": true }
  },
  {
    "key": "ctrl+alt+up",
    "command": "editor.action.insertCursorAbove",
    "args": { "logicalLine": true }
  }
]
```

This makes cursor additions move by real document lines, skipping visual word-wrap continuations.
